### Test 1: Save Permissions - Grant one
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/savePermissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2201,
  "grantPermissions": [
    "UP016"
  ]
}

### Test 2: Save Permissions - Revoke one
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/savePermissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2201,
  "revokePermissions": [
    "UP016"
  ]
}

### Test 3: Save Permissions - Change roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/savePermissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2201,
  "roleIds": [
    1000
  ]
}

### Test 4: Save Permissions - Invalid (full list and changes)
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/savePermissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2201,
  "permissions": [
    "UP013"
  ],
  "grantPermissions": [
    "UP016"
  ]
}
